<http://data.silknow.org/object/5aed978d-08ca-3110-9fb7-1c360c86a5f0>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress panel of woven silk satin, Lyon, ca. 1890-1899."@en , "Dress panel of woven silk. Shaped panel of patterned cream silk showing a full width, selvedge to selvedge, plus two triangular panels seamed on either side. A sewn hem at the bottom suggests the original skirt hem. The top of the panel shows tailored shaping and the sides have been unpicked.\n\nThe high-quality silk is of cream-coloured silk satin with a repeating vertical pattern of four stems of bamboo or similar trailing canes with leaves and berries. These groups of plants are woven at intervals of 2 inches (5 cms) and there are three repeats in the natural fabric width. The pattern is picked out in a ribbed effect in pale pink and golden yellow silk."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/e851dd54-3af9-3f6b-8df9-2ffe052b0b14> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress panel of woven silk. Shaped panel of patterned cream silk showing a full width, selvedge to selvedge, plus two triangular panels seamed on either side. A sewn hem at the bottom suggests the original skirt hem. The top of the panel shows tailored shaping and the sides have been unpicked.\n\nThe high-quality silk is of cream-coloured silk satin with a repeating vertical pattern of four stems of bamboo or similar trailing canes with leaves and berries. These groups of plants are woven at intervals of 2 inches (5 cms) and there are three repeats in the natural fabric width. The pattern is picked out in a ribbed effect in pale pink and golden yellow silk."@en , "Dress panel of woven silk satin, Lyon, ca. 1890-1899."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/5aed978d-08ca-3110-9fb7-1c360c86a5f0/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/5aed978d-08ca-3110-9fb7-1c360c86a5f0/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/5aed978d-08ca-3110-9fb7-1c360c86a5f0/dimension/6> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/5aed978d-08ca-3110-9fb7-1c360c86a5f0/dimension/4> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/5aed978d-08ca-3110-9fb7-1c360c86a5f0/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/5aed978d-08ca-3110-9fb7-1c360c86a5f0/dimension/5> ;
